  "geography": "Join by the official ISO3 geography identifier. Historical areas lacking one receive stable UNIDO-prefixed source codes and remain separate from current borders. Former Sudan and Ethiopia and Eritrea are African historical reporting areas. Other Africa membership uses the retained UN M49 classification.",
  "definitions": {
    "total": "Published D, manufacturing total. The source variable counts employees in reporting units; some series use persons engaged or full-time-equivalent jobs. Coverage varies by country and year.",
